### GET measures. Devuelve todas las medidas del POI y de los inversores
GET http://127.100.0.1:8500/measures
Content-Type: application/json


### POST setpoints. POST request to change active and reactive power references at POI. 
POST http://10.10.0.4:8200/setpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "record":true
}


### POST setpoints. POST request to change active and reactive power references at POI. 
POST http://127.0.0.1:8200/setpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "P_POI_ref":0.1, 
    "Q_POI_ref":0.0,
    "Q_POI_sin_ref_amplitude":0.5,
    "Q_POI_sin_ref_hz":0.1
}

### POST setpoints. POST request to change active and reactive power references at POI. 
POST http://127.0.0.1:8200/setpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "record":false
}

### POST setpoints. POST request to change active and reactive power references at POI. 
POST http://127.0.0.1:8200/setpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "stop_ppc":true
}


### POST change of irradiance in pu 
POST http://127.100.0.1:8500/irrad
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "irrad_LV0101":1,
    "irrad_LV0102":1
}


### GET Nos devuelve la "irradiancia" de cada inversor.
GET http://localhost:8500/irrad


